console.log("full object", rt);
console.log("wrong (type’s idea)", rt?.meta?.url);
console.log("right (slug map)", rt?.meta?.care_kutumba_fe);
```

Expected:

| Expression | Result |
|---|---|
| `rt.meta.url` | `undefined` |
| `rt.meta.care_kutumba_fe` | that plugin’s meta (`name`, `localPath` or `url`, …) |
| `Object.keys(rt.meta)` | slugs, e.g. `["care_kutumba_fe"]` |

If `rt` is `undefined`, plugins have not finished loading yet — wait and run again.

